Description: VeltOS Task Manager, a Windows 11 style task manager
 See the running apps, background and system processes with their CPU,
 memory and GPU use and end them; watch CPU, memory, disk, network and
 every GPU over the last minute; turn apps that start at sign-in on and
 off. Laid out like the Windows 11 Task Manager and opened with
 Ctrl+Shift+Esc.
